{
    "word": "pauldron",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7cf7ef94-88fc-3a79-a8b4-288a4ddad6e7",
                "word": "pauldron",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bfd6cef6-47d6-49d8-b63d-7076acf838fc",
                        "entry_id": "7cf7ef94-88fc-3a79-a8b4-288a4ddad6e7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pauldrons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04ec4e6b-c721-3027-846f-537230252b0f",
                        "entry_id": "7cf7ef94-88fc-3a79-a8b4-288a4ddad6e7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A component of plate armor that protects the shoulder, generally covering more than a spaulder, also protecting the armpit and overlapping with other armor over the upper chest and back."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7dc8b21-cf6e-4cdf-92dd-ddda40a320b2",
                                "sense_id": "04ec4e6b-c721-3027-846f-537230252b0f",
                                "text": "Upon the espaulieres are placed pauldrons, also ridged, with the edges turned up, so as to form the prototypes of pass-guards."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "185ef5fe-922c-4e30-8736-54e13fafc470",
                                "sense_id": "04ec4e6b-c721-3027-846f-537230252b0f",
                                "text": "[…] a pair of pauldrons with the light horizontal bar which in later years developed into the high neckguard of the sixteenth century; numbers of gauntlets, visors of helmets, and other pieces, the handling of which is a sheer joy […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "20aebdb9-1198-435c-8654-9ad6e9bc877e",
                                "sense_id": "04ec4e6b-c721-3027-846f-537230252b0f",
                                "text": "[…] the elbow cop or coudiere for the elbow; and the rerebrace or arriere-bras for the upper arm. The shoulder cop, pauldron or epauliere which covered the shoulder, and often a large part of the breast and back, was usually considered a part of the arm guard."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "790fe6d2-846b-4e57-afb5-8e051442c86f",
                                "sense_id": "04ec4e6b-c721-3027-846f-537230252b0f",
                                "text": "This rim involved a raised rolled edge on the rerebrace that was inserted into a raised lip on the lower lame of the pauldron."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b8113551-1556-4683-b20f-f21bf664c6b6",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cf7ef94-88fc-3a79-a8b4-288a4ddad6e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ec4e6b-c721-3027-846f-537230252b0f",
                        "source_sense_description": "plate armor that protects the shoulders",
                        "target_lang_word": "épaulière",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "épaulière",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e790d45-0e8d-3145-a515-3b629cc2c779",
                                        "entry_id": "aef1ef8b-1655-3b93-97fc-1533f24547af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie de l’armure d’un cavalier qui couvre et défend l’épaule."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Armurerie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bc5a79d-0240-4cfb-b22b-ed926666caa9",
                                                "sense_id": "0e790d45-0e8d-3145-a515-3b629cc2c779",
                                                "text": "… ; et, […], des épaulières de sa cuirasse, des gouttes de sang coulant sur l’armure du comte indiquaient que la pointe de l’épée avait pénétré par chaque ouverture qui lui avait été offerte."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27a70230-3c2b-36d8-9f1e-215062024ce3",
                                        "entry_id": "aef1ef8b-1655-3b93-97fc-1533f24547af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pièce de l’aile des insectes coléoptères."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91461b6d-e1de-3374-ae78-a745fcbe13be",
                                        "entry_id": "aef1ef8b-1655-3b93-97fc-1533f24547af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Élément de protection et de support pour caler entre le menton et l’épaule un instrument à cordes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d50dfd75-52b7-3f77-a9a2-ddc108d687ab",
                                        "entry_id": "aef1ef8b-1655-3b93-97fc-1533f24547af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bretelle de pantalon ou de jupe chez le jeune enfant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e973da5-e014-3032-9da0-7d59d275a271",
                                        "entry_id": "aef1ef8b-1655-3b93-97fc-1533f24547af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sous-vêtement de protection."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "323ec13c-66fc-426c-a04d-c33a6e195ad5",
                                                "sense_id": "1e973da5-e014-3032-9da0-7d59d275a271",
                                                "text": "Casque, épaulière, crampons et même protège-dents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa92dfbf-f5f7-4a84-98a1-0f05e677354b",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cf7ef94-88fc-3a79-a8b4-288a4ddad6e7",
                        "source_sense_id": "04ec4e6b-c721-3027-846f-537230252b0f",
                        "source_sense_description": "plate armor that protects the shoulders",
                        "target_lang_word": "Achsel",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Achsel",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06ee9975-cee3-307a-a276-aedf66fc1d09",
                                        "entry_id": "994f9424-cbef-3f58-97fa-68ef6532cf2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ansatzstelle des Oberarms am Oberkörper"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bed9c5b-5c7f-4cbd-b56a-435ec4e998bf",
                                                "sense_id": "06ee9975-cee3-307a-a276-aedf66fc1d09",
                                                "text": "Der Arm riss an der Achsel ab."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72d2c490-882f-4bd3-88e5-4dcc101a980c",
                                                "sense_id": "06ee9975-cee3-307a-a276-aedf66fc1d09",
                                                "text": "„Wolzogen zuckte die Achseln und verzog den Mund.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "315eb621-6f1a-366d-871f-a64fcdec6766",
                                        "entry_id": "994f9424-cbef-3f58-97fa-68ef6532cf2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mulde unter der Ansatzstelle des Oberarms"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9f9a459-ca3e-48dd-afcb-26e64fdddc26",
                                                "sense_id": "315eb621-6f1a-366d-871f-a64fcdec6766",
                                                "text": "„Lassehn zuckt die Achseln und macht eine unbestimmte Handbewegung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2dbb4d6-3795-4b13-95fa-043a15b17dc3",
                                                "sense_id": "315eb621-6f1a-366d-871f-a64fcdec6766",
                                                "text": "Sie sprühte Deo auf ihre Achsel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53b01c7c-affb-49df-90f0-7ff7fe5b55ef",
                                                "sense_id": "315eb621-6f1a-366d-871f-a64fcdec6766",
                                                "text": "„Seine Uhrkette aus Haaren und die Art, wie er die Remoularde rührte, offenbarte den erfahrenen Lebemann, und er aß, den Zipfel seiner Serviette unter die Achsel geklemmt, und ließ dabei allerhand Witze vom Stapel, die Pécuchet zum Lachen brachten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Achsel",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                        "entry_id": "2c9e2167-f993-3270-b0c7-63a68f954152",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Familienname, Nachname"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea2f3035-e29f-4570-9428-8aa2a292d435",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "Frau Achsel ist ein Genie im Verkauf."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a45e6e49-e9dc-4e99-b57c-92ba7b19e0e7",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "Herr Achsel wollte uns kein Interview geben."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5a4583b-036e-47fb-b794-a307d6c58be0",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "Die Achsels kommen heute aus Düsseldorf."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94b1a6d4-25d3-4f7c-9be3-0dadca626b13",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "Der Achsel trägt nie die Schals, die die Achsel ihm strickt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10c6db62-4603-4f7f-9a6a-a6f19c356af4",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "Das kann ich dir aber sagen: „Wenn die Frau Achsel kommt, geht der Herr Achsel.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b97e1281-853f-4851-a500-799c524d023e",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "Achsel kommt und geht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5da3c50-acaf-4571-af7a-60e0764aaadd",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "Achsels kamen, sahen und siegten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e6d81e1-934a-450e-9cf9-af07b53c35d1",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "An verregneten Herbsttagen ist Familie Achsels liebste Beschäftigung das Bemalen von Hühnereiern."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ff11bfd-d74d-4b41-910e-cbd2ab3dc695",
                                                "sense_id": "5a4628c9-1981-354e-b8d8-e5d019228213",
                                                "text": "An verschneiten Wintertagen ist die liebste Beschäftigung von Familie Achsel das Schmücken von Weihnachtsbäumen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
